headers {
  X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
}

docs {
  # Vision OCR - external REST API (/api/v1)

  1. Pick the **local** environment and set the secret `apiKey` to your `api.keys.<client>` value
     (secrets stay on your machine, they are not written to these files).
  2. Put a scan at `bruno/samples/sample.pdf` (the folder is git-ignored - never commit real documents).
  3. Run **Submit document**, then **Get document** until `final` is true.

  See README "External REST API".
}
